#. ja: 遊戯のエーテリアルホイールG1
#. de: Rad[p] der Erholung I
#. fr: tour du divertissement I
#. column 2: grade 1 wheels of recreation
#. column 8: A cylindrical wheel crafted from metal and aspected crystal which, when placed on a stand and spun repeatedly, accumulates an aetherial charge. When fully primed, the wheel can be used to initiate the company action Jackpot (increased MGP payout at the Manderville Gold Saucer).
#. column 9: Grade 1 Wheel of Recreation
msgctxt "Item:12214:0:0"
msgid "grade 1 wheel of recreation"
msgstr "Колесо развлечений I"

#. de: Räder[p] der Erholung I
#. fr: tours du divertissement I
#. column 0: grade 1 wheel of recreation
#. column 8: A cylindrical wheel crafted from metal and aspected crystal which, when placed on a stand and spun repeatedly, accumulates an aetherial charge. When fully primed, the wheel can be used to initiate the company action Jackpot (increased MGP payout at the Manderville Gold Saucer).
#. column 9: Grade 1 Wheel of Recreation
msgctxt "Item:12214:0:2"
msgid "grade 1 wheels of recreation"
msgstr "Колёса развлечений I"

#. ja: ホイールスタンドでチャージすることで、様々な効果が得られる小型魔器<br>[チャージ完了後、「MGPアップ」の効果を得られる]
#. de: Ein zylinderförmiges Rad aus Metall und Elementarkristallen, das eine ätherische Ladung generiert, wenn es aufgestellt und wiederholt gedreht wird. Sobald die Ladung ihr Maximum erreicht hat, kann das Rad verwendet werden, um das Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaftskommando MGP-Bonus (erhöhte MGP-Auszahlung im Manderville Gold Saucer) auszuführen.
#. fr: Ce cristal monté sur un support permet de diffuser une énergie bienfaisante lorsqu'il est chargé d'éther.<br>[Octroie l'effet “Gros lot<nbsp>: Les gains de points du Gold Saucer sont augmentés de 5% pendant 24 heures (temps réel)” après chargement]
#. column 0: grade 1 wheel of recreation
#. column 2: grade 1 wheels of recreation
#. column 9: Grade 1 Wheel of Recreation
msgctxt "Item:12214:0:8"
msgid "A cylindrical wheel crafted from metal and aspected crystal which, when placed on a stand and spun repeatedly, accumulates an aetherial charge. When fully primed, the wheel can be used to initiate the company action Jackpot (increased MGP payout at the Manderville Gold Saucer)."
msgstr "Металлическое колесо с кристаллом определённой стихии. Если установить его на подставку и вращать, оно накапливает эфир. Полностью заряженное колесо позволяет применить действие роты «Джекпот» и увеличить выигрыш в МГП в Золотом блюде Мандервилей."

