#. ja: ファーリーチカンバス
#. de: Farreach-Tuch
#. fr: rouleau de canevas de la côte des Adieux
#. column 2: rolls of Farreach canvas
#. column 8: Originally conceived by inhabitants of the sparsely settled Farreach to withstand the gale-force winds ceaselessly blowing on the Bloodbrine Sea, this rugged sailcloth is one of few materials suited to air travel.
#. column 9: Farreach Canvas
msgctxt "Item:12231:0:0"
msgid "roll of Farreach canvas"
msgstr "Рулон парусины из Фаррича"

#. de: Farreach-Tücher
#. fr: rouleaux de canevas de la côte des Adieux
#. column 0: roll of Farreach canvas
#. column 8: Originally conceived by inhabitants of the sparsely settled Farreach to withstand the gale-force winds ceaselessly blowing on the Bloodbrine Sea, this rugged sailcloth is one of few materials suited to air travel.
#. column 9: Farreach Canvas
msgctxt "Item:12231:0:2"
msgid "rolls of Farreach canvas"
msgstr "Рулоны парусины из Фаррича"

#. ja: 軽量かつ丈夫な厚手の粗布。柔軟さに欠けるため衣服には向かない
#. de: Ursprünglich von Bewohnern der dünn besiedelten Farreach erdacht, um den starken Winden auf dem Schwerblütigen Meer standzuhalten, ist dieses robuste Segeltuch eines der wenigen Materialien, die sich für Luftschiffe eignen.
#. fr: Une toile légère, épaisse et robuste. Sa rigidité ne la destine pas à la confection de vêtements.
#. column 0: roll of Farreach canvas
#. column 2: rolls of Farreach canvas
#. column 9: Farreach Canvas
msgctxt "Item:12231:0:8"
msgid "Originally conceived by inhabitants of the sparsely settled Farreach to withstand the gale-force winds ceaselessly blowing on the Bloodbrine Sea, this rugged sailcloth is one of few materials suited to air travel."
msgstr "Эту прочную парусину придумали жители малонаселённого Фаррича, чтобы выдерживать шквальные ветра над Кроваво-солёным морем. Это один из немногих материалов, пригодных для воздушных путешествий."

#. ja: ファーリーチカンバス
#. de: Farreach-Tuch
#. fr: Canevas de la côte des Adieux
#. column 0: roll of Farreach canvas
#. column 2: rolls of Farreach canvas
#. column 8: Originally conceived by inhabitants of the sparsely settled Farreach to withstand the gale-force winds ceaselessly blowing on the Bloodbrine Sea, this rugged sailcloth is one of few materials suited to air travel.
msgctxt "Item:12231:0:9"
msgid "Farreach Canvas"
msgstr "Парусина из Фаррича"

