msgstr "Клумба люпинов"

#. ja: 探検家の焚火炉
#. de: Entdecker-Feuerstelle
#. fr: feu de camp d'explorateur
#. column 2: explorer's campfires
#. column 8: All the essential culinary tools─camp stove, iron pot, and stump settle─for dining on the wild side.
#. column 9: Explorer's Campfire
msgctxt "Item:12235:0:0"
