#. ja: 虫入りアンバー
#. de: Stück[p] Bernstein mit Einschluss
#. fr: morceau d'ambre à insecte
#. column 2: amber-encased vilekin
#. column 8: A tiny vilekin unlike any currently found in Eorzea is trapped within this rock-solid piece of dried tree sap. Collectors will pay large sums for these rare treasures.
#. column 9: Amber-encased Vilekin
msgctxt "Item:12236:0:0"
msgid "amber-encased vilekin"
msgstr "Янтарь с насекомым"

#. de: Stücke[p] Bernstein mit Einschluss
#. fr: morceaux d'ambre à insecte
#. column 0: amber-encased vilekin
