#. de: Luftschiff-Registriermarke
#. fr: formulaire d'enregistrement d'aéronef
#. column 2: flight credits
#. column 8: Permission issued by the three Grand Companies, allowing flight of privately owned airships over public airspace. Depending on airship size, and number of airships in possession, multiple credits may be required to register a new vehicle.
#. column 9: Flight Credit
msgctxt "Item:12237:0:0"
msgid "flight credit"
msgstr "Разрешение на полёт"

