#. ja: ストーンラーヴァ
#. de: Steinfliegen-Nymphe
#. fr: nymphe de plécoptère
#. column 2: stonefly nymphs
#. column 8: Stonefly nymphs are constantly moving, making them easily discernible targets for poor-sighted fish. Live bait for freshwater fishing.
#. column 9: Stonefly Nymph
msgctxt "Item:12704:0:0"
msgid "stonefly nymph"
msgstr "нимфа веснянки"

#. de: Steinfliegen-Nymphen
