#. ja: レッドバルーン
#. de: rot[a] Ballonkäfer
#. fr: scaraballon rouge
#. column 2: red balloons
#. column 8: A bright-red breed of balloon bug found floating at higher elevations than its duller cousins. Live bait for both skyfishing and cloudfishing. Up to nine hundred and ninety-nine red balloons can be stacked together.
#. column 9: Red Balloon
msgctxt "Item:12708:0:0"
msgid "red balloon"
msgstr "красный жук-шарик"

#. de: rot[a] Ballonkäfer
