msgstr "Красный воздушный жук"

#. ja: マグマワーム
#. de: Magmawurm
#. fr: ver de magma
#. column 2: magma worms
#. column 8: A small worm with a stone-like shell encasing its entire body, protecting it from the extreme temperatures of the molten lava in which it resides. Live bait for hellfishing.
#. column 9: Magma Worm
msgctxt "Item:12709:0:0"
msgid "magma worm"
msgstr "магмовый червь"

#. de: Magmawürmer
#. fr: vers de magma
#. column 0: magma worm
#. column 8: A small worm with a stone-like shell encasing its entire body, protecting it from the extreme temperatures of the molten lava in which it resides. Live bait for hellfishing.
#. column 9: Magma Worm
msgctxt "Item:12709:0:2"
msgid "magma worms"
msgstr "магмовые черви"

#. ja: 溶岩の中に棲息する小型ワーム。溶岩釣り用活餌
#. de: Ein kleiner Wurm mit einer steinartigen Schale, die seinen gesamten Körper umgibt, und ihn so vor den extremen Temperaturen in geschmolzener Lava schützt. Lebendköder fürs Höllenfischen.
#. fr: Un ver recouvert d'une coquille très épaisse qui lui permet de vivre dans la lave en fusion. Il sert d'appât pour la pêche infernale.
#. column 0: magma worm
#. column 2: magma worms
#. column 9: Magma Worm
msgctxt "Item:12709:0:8"
msgid "A small worm with a stone-like shell encasing its entire body, protecting it from the extreme temperatures of the molten lava in which it resides. Live bait for hellfishing."
msgstr "Небольшой червь, всё тело которого защищает панцирь, похожий на камень. Он спасает червя от экстремальной температуры расплавленной лавы, где тот обитает. Живая наживка для ловли в лаве."

#. ja: マグマワーム
#. de: Magmawurm
#. fr: Ver de magma
#. column 0: magma worm
#. column 2: magma worms
#. column 8: A small worm with a stone-like shell encasing its entire body, protecting it from the extreme temperatures of the molten lava in which it resides. Live bait for hellfishing.
msgctxt "Item:12709:0:9"
msgid "Magma Worm"
msgstr "Магмовый червь"

#. ja: バイオレットワーム
#. de: Eufelswurm
#. fr: ver violet
#. column 2: fiend worms
#. column 8: Discovered almost simultaneously by three naturalists, this strange creature was also named the “demon worm” and the “goddess worm” until a best-two-out-of-three round of stone-parchment-shears settled the naming problem once and for all. Fiend worms are one of the few baits suitable for aetherfishing, as the vilekin will remain alive in the sludge even when submerged.
#. column 9: Fiend Worm
msgctxt "Item:12710:0:0"
msgid "fiend worm"
msgstr "червь-демон"

#. de: Eufelswürmer
#. fr: vers violets
#. column 0: fiend worm
#. column 8: Discovered almost simultaneously by three naturalists, this strange creature was also named the “demon worm” and the “goddess worm” until a best-two-out-of-three round of stone-parchment-shears settled the naming problem once and for all. Fiend worms are one of the few baits suitable for aetherfishing, as the vilekin will remain alive in the sludge even when submerged.
#. column 9: Fiend Worm
msgctxt "Item:12710:0:2"
msgid "fiend worms"
msgstr "черви-демоны"

#. ja: 正体不明の謎めいたワーム。魔泉釣り用活餌
#. de: Eufelswürmer sind einer der wenigen Köder, die sich fürs Ätherfischen eignen, da sie auch tief im Schlamm steckend noch überleben können.
#. fr: Un ver d'origine inconnue. Certains l'appellent “ver démoniaque” ou encore “ver de la Déesse”. Il sert d'appât pour la pêche éthérée.
#. column 0: fiend worm
#. column 2: fiend worms
#. column 9: Fiend Worm
msgctxt "Item:12710:0:8"
msgid "Discovered almost simultaneously by three naturalists, this strange creature was also named the “demon worm” and the “goddess worm” until a best-two-out-of-three round of stone-parchment-shears settled the naming problem once and for all. Fiend worms are one of the few baits suitable for aetherfishing, as the vilekin will remain alive in the sludge even when submerged."
msgstr "Это странное существо почти одновременно открыли трое натуралистов. Его называли и «червём-демоном», и «червём-богиней», пока спор не разрешили в состязании до двух побед в игре «камень, пергамент, ножницы». Червь-демон — одна из немногих наживок для ловли в эфирном иле: даже под водой эти мерзкие твари остаются живыми."

#. ja: バイオレットワーム
#. de: Eufelswurm
#. fr: Ver violet
#. column 0: fiend worm
#. column 2: fiend worms
#. column 8: Discovered almost simultaneously by three naturalists, this strange creature was also named the “demon worm” and the “goddess worm” until a best-two-out-of-three round of stone-parchment-shears settled the naming problem once and for all. Fiend worms are one of the few baits suitable for aetherfishing, as the vilekin will remain alive in the sludge even when submerged.
msgctxt "Item:12710:0:9"
msgid "Fiend Worm"
msgstr "Червь-демон"

#. ja: ブルートリーチ
#. de: Grobegel
#. fr: sangsue bestiale
#. column 2: brute leeches
#. column 8: A fat bloodsucking worm often found attached to large fish or the legs of wading fauna. Live bait for freshwater fishing.
#. column 9: Brute Leech
